# ── Step 1: Create a Telegram bot ─────────────────────────────────────────
#
#  1. Open Telegram and search for @BotFather
#  2. Send:  /newbot
#  3. Choose a name (e.g. "My Stock Alerts")
#  4. Choose a username ending in "bot" (e.g. "mystockalerts_bot")
#  5. BotFather replies with a token like:
#        123456789:ABCdefGHIjklMNOpqrSTUvwxYZ
#  6. Paste it below ↓

BOT_TOKEN=

# ── Step 2: Get your chat ID ───────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#  1. Open Telegram and search for @userinfobot
#  2. Send any message (e.g. "hi")
#  3. It replies with your numeric ID like:  123456789
#  4. Paste it below ↓
#
#  ⚠️  Without CHAT_ID the bot answers commands but won't send
#      automatic price / news alerts.

CHAT_ID=
